WEBVTT

00:36:29.780 --> 00:36:31.796
who's getting bombarded with requests,

00:36:31.820 --> 00:36:33.820
so they can get backup on their team.

00:36:33.844 --> 00:36:35.656
(Music)

00:36:35.680 --> 00:36:38.326
Formal support helps to prevent burnout,

00:36:38.350 --> 00:36:40.676
but ultimately, the culture
of informal support

00:36:40.700 --> 00:36:43.306
matters just as much, if not more,

00:36:43.330 --> 00:36:46.226
and organizations
can take steps to nurture it.

00:36:46.250 --> 00:36:48.291
At South Metro Station 45,

00:36:48.315 --> 00:36:51.206
people know where to go
for unconditional support.

00:36:51.230 --> 00:36:53.551
It's probably the busiest place
in the station,

00:36:53.575 --> 00:36:55.544
says firefighter Dan Rivers.

00:36:55.568 --> 00:36:57.697
Dan Rivers: It's the only 
place in the world

00:36:57.707 --> 00:37:01.396
where you can have a stack
of money, 100s, 50, whatever,